        "description": "Exclusion of other types of breast carcinoma and sarcoma by morphology and immunophenotype",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Histopathological confirmation of metaplastic components plus immunohistochemical profile consistent with triple-negative breast cancer",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires integration of histopathology and immunohistochemistry; molecular testing may assist in difficult cases."
